WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.977
Start with the job, not the tool.

00:00:02.977 --> 00:00:06.804
AI could organize approved requirements or suggest neutral questions.

00:00:06.804 --> 00:00:12.333
But verifying a price against the authorized record is a direct human check.

00:00:12.333 --> 00:00:17.010
Giving AI every step creates extra work without necessarily creating value.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:21.263
The right role is the one that serves the task.
